      "content": "idk i feel like i'm just being overcautious. my buddy does intense yoga every single day and says it's the only thing that keeps his back from locking up. if i just do some very controlled, intense stretching maybe i can just \"stretch out\" the nerve so it's not being squeezed anymore? it feels like if i just get the tension released it'll stop the shooting sensation. u sure it's really that risky to just try and work through the tightness?",
